1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:06,160
The Race in the Forest

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:19,840
Tomorrow, forest animals open running contest to choose fastest animal.

3
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:25,560
Little Horse likes it very much.

4
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:32,820
He is sure he will win.

5
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:41,320
Little Horse is confident about his hooves.

6
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:55,080
He doesn't go to blacksmith to check hooves according to father's advice.

7
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:00,160
Contest has arrived.

8
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:06,280
The shout "Start!" sounds.

9
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:19,820
First round… Second round… Little Horse leads with long healthy steps.

10
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:36,700
Suddenly he feels discomfort in leg: one hoof loose then falls off.

11
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:44,500
Sharp nail pierces leg making Little Horse very painful.

12
00:01:44,970 --> 00:01:54,340
He runs limping and finally stops completely.

13
00:01:55,060 --> 00:02:09,220
Seeing friends pass by, Little Horse turns red-eyed, regretful for not following father's advice.

14
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:27,160
Little Horse draws valuable lesson: never be complacent, even for smallest thing.

